# ☕ Coffee Shop Sales Analysis – Excel

## 📌 Overview

This project analyzes coffee shop sales data using Microsoft Excel to understand sales performance, customer purchasing patterns, and product demand.

The project demonstrates the process of transforming raw sales data into meaningful business insights through data cleaning, analysis, and visualization.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Analyze overall sales performance
- Identify sales trends and patterns
- Analyze product-level performance
- Understand customer purchasing behavior
- Identify high-demand products and sales periods
- Present insights through an Excel dashboard

## 🛠️ Tools & Skills

- Microsoft Excel
- Data Cleaning & Preparation
- Excel Formulas
- Pivot Tables
- Pivot Charts
- Data Analysis
- Data Visualization
- Dashboard Development

## 📊 Analysis

The analysis covers:

- Sales and revenue trends
- Product performance
- Customer purchasing patterns
- Sales by time period
- High-performing products
- Key business metrics

## 📈 Dashboard

An interactive Excel dashboard was created to present important sales metrics and trends in a clear and user-friendly format.

## 📁 Project Files

- Coffee_Sales_Analysis.xlsx – Excel analysis and workbook
- Coffee_Sales_Dataset.xlsx – Source sales dataset
- Coffee_Sales_Dashboard.xlsx – Dashboard/report

## 💡 Key Takeaway

This project demonstrates the use of Microsoft Excel for data cleaning, analysis, visualization, and business reporting to support data-driven decision-making.
